{"5066830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Explorers 2", "steam_appid": 5066830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5081320], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/9ad2e0b238130d090d456fb20f443993.poster.avif?t=1788320541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/9ad2e0b238130d090d456fb20f443993.webm?t=1788320541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/9ad2e0b238130d090d456fb20f443993.mp4?t=1788320541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the darkness. Command your allies. Build your legacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The war between Chaos and the gods left the world broken.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Kingdoms are collapsing, ancient horrors are awakening, and supernatural forces are spreading across the land. As a warrior marked by tragedy, you must gather allies, uncover forgotten secrets, and build enough power to confront the forces threatening to consume everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dungeon Explorers 2 is a dark fantasy RPG that combines first-person dungeon crawling, tactical battles, party-based combat, faction management, exploration, meaningful choices, and romance in a single evolving adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/1cbb1bd952d9f1278a92b5713f513367.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/1cbb1bd952d9f1278a92b5713f513367.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=861 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Enter Deadly First-Person Dungeons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Descend into dangerous labyrinths filled with roaming monsters, hidden passages, deadly traps, powerful enemies, and valuable treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Navigate every corridor carefully, uncover secret rooms, avoid threats you are not prepared to face, or hunt them down for greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every expedition demands preparation, awareness, and courage.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/cf7e03ef37479196a2410b837e5ce0f6.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/cf7e03ef37479196a2410b837e5ce0f6.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=897 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Command Tactical Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lead your warriors across strategic battlefields in turn-based tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Position your units, exploit enemy weaknesses, protect vulnerable allies, and use each companion’s abilities to turn impossible battles in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your decisions on the battlefield can determine who survives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/d52e493b2e05cca38a1b201bef73ee65.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/d52e493b2e05cca38a1b201bef73ee65.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=859 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <strong>Fight Alongside Your Party</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face enemies through a classic front-view battle system built around party composition, equipment, abilities, and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Recruit new companions, strengthen your group, unlock new skills, and create a party capable of confronting increasingly dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/b52c5453c56a54a57071033e5e8474b8.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/b52c5453c56a54a57071033e5e8474b8.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=873 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build and Manage Your Faction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your influence extends far beyond the battlefield.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Recruit warriors, guards, gatherers, merchants, and specialists. Send followers on missions, collect resources, protect refugees, respond to emergencies, and decide how your growing faction should operate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your companions will offer advice, but every final decision belongs to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/cebfb084db478f2aaf48f906bf7e7506.avif?t=1788320541\" width=1280 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make Choices That Matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your actions shape your reputation, alliances, relationships, and personal path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose between virtue and ambition. Support rival factions, resolve conflicts, decide who deserves your trust, and face the consequences of every major decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Different choices can unlock new opportunities, alter relationships, and change the direction of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/2fea8cff404fd06990d68f91fa6245ba.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/2fea8cff404fd06990d68f91fa6245ba.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=855 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Forge Meaningful Relationships</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet warriors, merchants, nobles, adventurers, outlaws, and mysterious beings from across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn their trust, discover their personal stories, fight beside them, and develop relationships that can grow into lasting romances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/9877d243cb20a98621f940539e745e09.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/9877d243cb20a98621f940539e745e09.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=939 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore a Dark Fantasy World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel through cities, forests, roads, fortresses, refugee settlements, ancient ruins, and forgotten places shaped by war and supernatural forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Accept quests, discover hidden events, visit specialized shops, train new abilities, acquire powerful equipment, and encounter characters with their own goals, loyalties, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/ddecabf2cc278ba733098dcca6a3598e.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/ddecabf2cc278ba733098dcca6a3598e.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Create the Warrior You Want to Become</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your choices define your journey.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Develop your abilities, customize your equipment, recruit the companions you trust, and decide what kind of leader you will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will you protect those who cannot defend themselves, pursue power at any cost, or carve out a path between both extremes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/13024ed5bef7f81f2e6ffe7706e9ae47.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/13024ed5bef7f81f2e6ffe7706e9ae47.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=869 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Challenge Chaos Itself</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ancient churches, ambitious nobles, legendary warriors, forgotten gods, and servants of Chaos are all fighting for control of a wounded world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strengthen your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>And prepare to challenge forces far greater than yourself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/7ec035ad047309851dbbf9b95c6a7fca.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/7ec035ad047309851dbbf9b95c6a7fca.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Early Access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dungeon Explorers 2 is currently in Early Access and already includes its core dungeon exploration, tactical combat, party battles, faction management, relationship, progression, and choice-driven systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Future updates will continue expanding the world with new dungeons, quests, characters, enemies, events, locations, relationships, and story content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world is falling into darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your journey begins now.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb