by war and supernatural forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Accept quests, discover hidden events, visit specialized shops, train new abilities, acquire powerful equipment, and encounter characters with their own goals, loyalties, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/ddecabf2cc278ba733098dcca6a3598e.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/ddecabf2cc278ba733098dcca6a3598e.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Create the Warrior You Want to Become</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your choices define your journey.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Develop your abilities, customize your equipment, recruit the companions you trust, and decide what kind of leader you will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will you protect those who cannot defend themselves, pursue power at any cost, or carve out a path between both extremes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/13024ed5bef7f81f2e6ffe7706e9ae47.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/13024ed5bef7f81f2e6ffe7706e9ae47.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=869 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Challenge Chaos Itself</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ancient churches, ambitious nobles, legendary warriors, forgotten gods, and servants of Chaos are all fighting for control of a wounded world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strengthen your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>And prepare to challenge forces far greater than yourself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras/7ec035ad047309851dbbf9b95c6a7fca.avif?t=1788320541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/extras_big/7ec035ad047309851dbbf9b95c6a7fca.webp?t=1788320541 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Early Access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dungeon Explorers 2 is currently in Early Access and already includes its core dungeon exploration, tactical combat, party battles, faction management, relationship, progression, and choice-driven systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Future updates will continue expanding the world with new dungeons, quests, characters, enemies, events, locations, relationships, and story content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world is falling into darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your journey begins now.</i></p>", "short_description": "Explore deadly first-person dungeons, command your allies in tactical battles, build a powerful faction, forge lasting relationships, and shape the fate of a dark fantasy world consumed by Chaos.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066830/49d6654a15361a754879797ae83400116bb1326e/header.jpg?t=1788320